여유로워 편안하게 텐트를 칠 수 있다. 산책로가 잘되어 있어 천천히 피톤치드를 맡으며 걸어보자. 주변관광지로 표충사, 밀양 얼음골, 호박소, 영남루, 얼음골케이블카, 청도프로방스 등이 있다.","updated":"2024-08-08","facilities":[{"k":"주요시설","v":"글램핑시설(14면)","items":["글램핑시설(14면)"]},{"k":"글램핑 내부시설","v":"침대 · TV · 냉장고 · 취사도구 · 내부화장실","items":["침대","TV","냉장고","취사도구","내부화장실"]},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"불가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"},{"k":"안전시설현황","v":"소화기 (14) · 화재감지기 (14)","items":["소화기 (14)","화재감지기 (14)"]}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/57456PRslHJ9i1FGEfj71BHU.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/3985E73ReQWEIe4N2U8bRLvj.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/88162zWH9ZOrPptwNvFfz2bx.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/7010ADTUI4cWawKaWuMTjmxl.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/0629hUrQRZ7E2Bfw2u9p1QD3.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/77459Uke3a2pMr0k6WLLwmas.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/4252U9pbAjaOHQvKjNNLegsO.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/6541y4LxjhpMIL5F0j5pgHcd.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/66537KAIDWiWey73YmIijRmQ.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/97256Vsu0dLigpfYaSxVVDbo.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1025/7789ufGVGPL17NOLcXdfEma5.jpg"],"guide":[{"title":"글램핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"글램핑","values":["60,000 ~160,000","0","0","0"]}]}}],"checked_at":"2026-10-20T04:40:10.696Z"}}